WEBVTT

01:40.080 --> 01:41.840
FILIAL PIETY, VIRTUOUS,
FAITHFUL, UNSWERVING

01:46.560 --> 01:47.400
ZHENNV HALL

01:47.480 --> 01:49.040
I have a perfect solution.

01:50.800 --> 01:51.760
What is it?

01:52.320 --> 01:53.240
Starting today,

01:54.600 --> 01:55.600
I

01:56.320 --> 01:57.680
will be Jiang Li.

02:05.680 --> 02:07.360
Jiang Li never left Zhennv Hall

02:07.920 --> 02:09.400
in the past ten years anyway.

02:10.080 --> 02:11.320
It has been ten years.

02:11.880 --> 02:13.960
No one knows what she looks like by now.

02:14.040 --> 02:15.800
Besides, you call the shots here.

02:16.520 --> 02:18.640
No one would dare to defy you.

02:19.200 --> 02:20.200
But…

02:21.560 --> 02:22.680
What's your motive?

02:23.880 --> 02:26.080
She's still better off than me.

02:27.600 --> 02:29.720
She's the daughter
of the Chief Secretariat.

02:30.880 --> 02:32.480
It's better than a peasant woman like me.

02:33.920 --> 02:36.520
Perhaps the Jiang family
will remember their daughter someday.

02:37.160 --> 02:39.360
Then I can live a life of luxury.

02:42.560 --> 02:43.600
Do we have a deal?

03:18.000 --> 03:19.120
Chief,

03:19.200 --> 03:20.760
Ms. Jiang still dares to lie in her bed?

03:22.400 --> 03:23.800
Tell everyone

03:23.880 --> 03:24.960
to butt out

03:25.480 --> 03:26.360
of Jiang Li's affairs.

03:26.440 --> 03:27.440
Yes.

03:28.000 --> 03:29.240
She'll be recuperating here

03:29.880 --> 03:31.040
for the next seven days.

04:42.160 --> 04:43.000
Tong'er.

04:43.960 --> 04:44.840
Tong'er.

04:45.800 --> 04:46.840
What's the matter with you?

04:47.320 --> 04:48.440
If not for you,

04:48.520 --> 04:50.360
her ladyship won't die!

04:50.440 --> 04:51.680
But you're an ingrate

04:51.760 --> 04:53.840
and you even stole her identity!

04:53.920 --> 04:56.200
Today, I'm going to kill you

04:56.280 --> 04:57.680
- to avenge her ladyship!
- Tong'er!

04:59.000 --> 04:59.880
Tong'er.

04:59.960 --> 05:01.120
Tong'er.

05:01.200 --> 05:02.080
Tong'er!

05:02.640 --> 05:03.640
Do you think it's enough

05:03.720 --> 05:05.440
to kill me and the Chief?

05:05.520 --> 05:07.440
What about those
who sent Jiang Li to Zhennv Hall?

05:08.160 --> 05:10.280
What about the people
who ignored her for ten years?

05:10.920 --> 05:12.720
Do you think
they would feel sad and sorry?

05:13.320 --> 05:15.520
They won't!

05:16.680 --> 05:18.040
They would just feign sympathy,

05:18.120 --> 05:19.520
forget about the whole thing,

05:19.600 --> 05:21.840
and live prosperously
and comfortably in their rich family.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.240
Is that what you want?

05:23.320 --> 05:25.080
Then her ladyship would've died in vain!

05:25.160 --> 05:26.280
His lordship…

05:26.800 --> 05:28.640
His lordship
will give her ladyship justice.

05:28.720 --> 05:30.680
His lordship will…

05:33.840 --> 05:34.680
I…

05:34.760 --> 05:35.840
Will he give her justice?

05:36.840 --> 05:39.560
Chancellor Jiang ignored his daughter
for ten years.

05:39.640 --> 05:41.920
He finally got rid of her
now that she's dead.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.760
And he'll give her justice?

05:44.320 --> 05:45.760
Besides, what can he do?

05:45.840 --> 05:47.560
Shut down Zhennv Hall

05:47.640 --> 05:49.640
and take Li'er's body
for a fancy funeral back home?

05:49.720 --> 05:52.440
Wouldn't she be buried
with a bad reputation then?

05:53.040 --> 05:54.040
Then what?

05:54.520 --> 05:55.720
Her stepmother

05:55.800 --> 05:57.720
gets praised for being merciful?

06:22.560 --> 06:23.560
Tong'er.

06:26.600 --> 06:28.680
I need Jiang Li's identity indeed.

06:30.120 --> 06:31.360
What exactly are you planning to do?

06:36.840 --> 06:38.400
Jiang Li's reputation and my reputation

06:39.640 --> 06:41.320
were both tainted.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.680
No one was willing to believe us.

06:46.160 --> 06:47.320
But Li'er believed in me

06:49.080 --> 06:50.280
and I believed in her.

06:53.640 --> 06:54.760
However,

06:56.000 --> 06:57.520
Li'er is dead now.

06:58.520 --> 06:59.920
She can't clear her own name.

07:02.000 --> 07:03.640
Let me help her clear it.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.480
They think

07:09.760 --> 07:12.200
our reputation will forever
be tainted, don't they?

07:13.360 --> 07:14.880
Let's show them

07:16.160 --> 07:17.320
how you and I

07:19.200 --> 07:21.360
can clear

07:23.640 --> 07:24.640
our names.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.480
Do a thorough cleaning.

07:37.560 --> 07:39.240
Clean every nook and cranny,

07:39.320 --> 07:40.600
especially under the trees.

07:41.400 --> 07:43.080
Pull yourselves together.

07:43.160 --> 07:45.240
Make the whole place squeaky clean.

07:46.000 --> 07:48.560
Do your tasks well.

08:02.520 --> 08:03.560
Tong'er.

08:03.640 --> 08:04.480
Tong'er.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.160
Why did you come out?

08:09.000 --> 08:11.160
It must be difficult
collecting firewood all by yourself.

08:12.000 --> 08:12.960
I'll go with you tomorrow.

08:13.040 --> 08:15.520
But the Chief said
you can't leave this courtyard for now.

08:16.440 --> 08:17.360
I won't touch it again.

08:17.440 --> 08:18.400
Such curiousity.

08:19.400 --> 08:20.800
- I won't do it again.
- Only the Chief

08:20.880 --> 08:21.960
can touch the lantern.

08:22.040 --> 08:23.880
You're disobedient and insensible.

08:23.960 --> 08:25.640
- I won't do it again.
- Quit staring, go.

08:25.720 --> 08:26.600
- They might see you.
- Such…

08:26.680 --> 08:28.720
- Why can't we touch the lantern?
- Why are you still here?

08:28.800 --> 08:30.920
We can't light a lantern
and roam around at night.

08:31.000 --> 08:33.400
Lanterns can only be lit
outside the ancestral shrine,

08:33.480 --> 08:36.440
so only the Chief can light them.

08:36.520 --> 08:38.200
No one else can touch them.

08:43.760 --> 08:45.160
"There are four feminine virtues.

08:45.240 --> 08:48.160
Feminine conduct, feminine speech,

08:48.240 --> 08:51.360
feminine comportment, feminine works.

08:51.440 --> 08:53.280
What is feminine conduct?"

09:04.560 --> 09:05.560
Nice needlework.

09:07.120 --> 09:08.240
I had a lot

09:08.760 --> 09:09.720
of practice.

09:10.480 --> 09:11.640
I'll get everything ready

09:12.120 --> 09:13.760
in a couple of days

09:14.480 --> 09:16.560
and introduce you as Jiang Li to everyone.

09:17.200 --> 09:20.480
Then you can show yourself.

09:20.560 --> 09:21.920
Thank you, Chief.

09:28.040 --> 09:31.960
KIND AND MORAL REPUTATION

09:39.880 --> 09:40.840
You can give it to me.

10:05.200 --> 10:07.600
"But it's taught to men but not women…"

10:13.760 --> 10:15.280
You're a smart girl.

10:15.840 --> 10:17.640
As long as you obey me,

10:18.920 --> 10:20.560
you won't go hungry.

10:20.640 --> 10:22.560
I'll do as you say, Chief.

10:24.680 --> 10:25.680
Chief,

10:26.920 --> 10:28.440
did you change your incense today?

10:29.560 --> 10:31.760
No talking while working.

10:33.320 --> 10:34.640
Take care, Chief.

11:05.000 --> 11:08.920
At 7:15 p.m., lie still in bed.

11:10.360 --> 11:13.880
Having reveries
and not sleeping is unclean.

11:16.560 --> 11:20.000
Venturing out at night is impure.

11:22.800 --> 11:26.200
At 7:15 p.m., lie still in bed.

11:27.040 --> 11:28.560
Zhennv Hall is heavily guarded.

11:29.360 --> 11:31.640
Her ladyship and I
lived here for ten years

11:31.720 --> 11:33.840
and never got a chance to escape.

11:34.400 --> 11:36.600
Now, I'm afraid it's even harder.

11:38.640 --> 11:39.720
Where are you going?

11:41.360 --> 11:42.760
I want to go out for some fresh air.

11:43.600 --> 11:45.600
No, going out at this hour
is considered unclean.

11:45.680 --> 11:46.520
You'll get beaten up.

11:47.280 --> 11:49.240
Everyone has turned off the lights
and gone to bed.

11:49.720 --> 11:51.800
I don't think I'll get caught
if I go out now.

11:52.360 --> 11:54.640
The reason we have a rule
against going out at night

11:55.240 --> 11:56.280
is because

11:57.120 --> 11:58.880
there was once a girl here

11:58.960 --> 12:01.280
who sneaked out at night to meet her lover

12:01.360 --> 12:03.240
and ended up
falling off a cliff and dying.

12:03.760 --> 12:05.400
But her spirit remained

12:05.480 --> 12:06.800
and haunted Zhennv Hall at night.

12:06.880 --> 12:09.880
After that, another girl
sneaked out to have fun.

12:11.040 --> 12:12.720
And she saw the ghost

12:13.320 --> 12:14.960
and was nearly frightened to death.

12:15.040 --> 12:17.480
Could that be just a story
to discourage you

12:18.000 --> 12:18.920
from venturing outside?

12:19.000 --> 12:20.240
No, it's true.

12:20.840 --> 12:22.680
That girl remembered it clearly.

12:23.240 --> 12:25.920
The female ghost was dressed like us

12:26.000 --> 12:27.440
and she was tall.

12:27.520 --> 12:29.160
It's so creepy.

12:29.720 --> 12:30.920
A tall, female ghost?

13:01.520 --> 13:02.360
After three days,

13:02.880 --> 13:05.000
Mrs. Liu will be
visiting Zhennv Hall on her way

13:05.080 --> 13:07.080
to the ceremony
in the middle of the month.

13:08.280 --> 13:09.680
Since it's a long journey,

13:09.760 --> 13:12.160
Mrs. Liu will be spending the night here.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.560
In the next few days, give orders

13:15.160 --> 13:17.120
to make sure Zhennv Hall is very clean,

13:17.920 --> 13:20.560
so Mrs. Liu will feel comfortable.

13:21.960 --> 13:22.880
Got it.

13:25.920 --> 13:27.520
On the day of Mrs. Liu's arrival,

13:27.600 --> 13:29.280
make sure those two stay in the room.

13:29.760 --> 13:30.840
Don't let them roam about,

13:32.360 --> 13:34.160
lest they offend our guest.

13:35.640 --> 13:36.600
Yes.

13:39.880 --> 13:42.480
The wife of Liu Yuanfeng,
Vice Minister of Revenue.

13:44.360 --> 13:45.240
Tong'er.

13:46.240 --> 13:47.200
Do you know her?

13:47.280 --> 13:48.880
If my memory serves me right,

13:49.680 --> 13:51.760
she was Madam Ye's good friend.

13:52.520 --> 13:53.680
The hairpin you're wearing

13:53.760 --> 13:55.880
was a gift from her to Madam Ye.

14:00.640 --> 14:02.880
You must be tired, Mrs. Liu.

14:02.960 --> 14:05.200
One is never too tired to give out alms.

14:06.160 --> 14:07.960
- Greetings, Mrs. Liu.
- Greetings, Mrs. Liu.

14:13.080 --> 14:15.280
Zhennv Hall is so well-kept.

14:15.920 --> 14:17.320
You obviously worked very hard.

14:17.400 --> 14:19.960
Sorry for visiting on such short notice.

14:20.040 --> 14:21.640
Not at all.

14:21.720 --> 14:23.680
We're very grateful for your visit.

14:24.560 --> 14:25.880
We've already prepared your room.

14:25.960 --> 14:27.960
I hope you can make do for the night.

14:28.560 --> 14:29.600
This way, please.

14:32.520 --> 14:35.200
ZHENNV HALL

14:43.760 --> 14:44.680
Tong'er.

14:45.760 --> 14:46.720
Tong'er.

14:47.200 --> 14:48.400
Wake up.

14:51.360 --> 14:52.200
Tonight

14:52.720 --> 14:54.520
is our only chance to leave this place.

14:55.680 --> 14:56.560
How?

14:57.280 --> 14:58.120
Through Mrs. Liu.

14:59.000 --> 15:00.040
But Mrs. Liu has always known

15:00.120 --> 15:02.240
that her ladyship was staying here,

15:02.320 --> 15:04.680
yet she never came to send her regards.

15:04.760 --> 15:06.440
Besides, without
the Jiang family's instruction,

15:06.520 --> 15:08.040
can she get us out of here?

15:13.000 --> 15:16.240
Give this hairpin to Mrs. Liu.

15:19.760 --> 15:21.520
Will this work?

15:21.600 --> 15:24.280
Tell Mrs. Liu that Jiang Li is in trouble.

15:24.840 --> 15:26.880
Once she sees this hairpin,
she'll surely follow you.

15:27.480 --> 15:29.440
But everyone here

15:29.520 --> 15:30.680
reveres the Chief.

15:31.240 --> 15:33.040
Even if Mrs. Liu is willing
to stand up for us,

15:33.600 --> 15:35.680
if the Chief denies it,

15:35.760 --> 15:37.120
she might even falsely accuse us.

15:37.200 --> 15:38.640
What if Mrs. Liu

15:38.720 --> 15:41.400
sees the Chief's inappropriate behavior?

15:42.480 --> 15:43.680
You mean…

15:43.760 --> 15:46.480
Did you notice the Chief's scent?

15:47.440 --> 15:50.040
She wears makeup every day.
What's so strange about that?

15:50.600 --> 15:53.080
Is it every day or just sometimes?

15:54.240 --> 15:56.360
I don't think it's daily.

15:57.120 --> 15:58.320
Now, you're getting it.

15:58.880 --> 16:00.600
While I first read Lessons for Women,

16:00.680 --> 16:02.840
I noticed a scent on the Chief's body.

16:02.920 --> 16:05.880
It was no ordinary scent.

16:05.960 --> 16:08.720
It was the scent of ylang-ylang.

16:09.360 --> 16:10.400
The scent of ylang-ylang?

16:10.960 --> 16:13.840
It's used by married couples
for sexual attraction.

16:15.360 --> 16:17.960
How do you know that?

16:19.560 --> 16:23.080
Madam, Mr. Shen hasn't visited you
in the past few days.

16:23.160 --> 16:24.840
I prepared this for you.

16:28.960 --> 16:29.840
What is this?

16:30.560 --> 16:31.560
The scent of ylang-ylang.

16:39.480 --> 16:41.200
Whenever the Chief smells of ylang-ylang,

16:41.840 --> 16:43.840
the lantern would be hung high,
like tonight.

16:44.720 --> 16:46.000
When the Chief doesn't smell
of ylang-ylang,

16:46.080 --> 16:47.680
the lantern wouldn't be hung as high.

16:48.840 --> 16:50.920
So there's a hidden meaning
to the lantern.

16:51.000 --> 16:54.800
Isn't there a place
called Helin Temple nearby?

16:55.360 --> 16:57.040
Yes, it's on the mountaintop
opposite here.

16:58.520 --> 17:01.080
The day I sneaked out
to collect firewood for you,

17:01.560 --> 17:03.560
I deliberately wandered
towards Helin Temple.

17:04.520 --> 17:06.599
I noticed that when the lantern is raised,

17:07.119 --> 17:08.760
it's visible on the mountain opposite us.

17:09.520 --> 17:12.440
And when the lantern is lowered,
it's obscured from view.

17:14.599 --> 17:17.720
I went to Helin Temple
to light an incense before.

17:18.599 --> 17:20.640
They hold a ceremony every other night.

17:21.680 --> 17:22.920
Whenever there was a ceremony,

17:23.560 --> 17:25.839
the Chief would smell of ylang-ylang

17:26.400 --> 17:27.839
and the lantern is visible

17:27.920 --> 17:29.160
from the mountain across us.

17:29.240 --> 17:30.480
What does that mean?

17:30.560 --> 17:32.440
It means the lantern

17:32.520 --> 17:34.880
is a signal to the participants
of Helin Temple's ceremony.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.240
Exactly.

17:36.320 --> 17:39.080
But what does that tell us?

17:39.760 --> 17:41.240
Could it just be a coincidence?

17:42.240 --> 17:43.280
It's not a coincidence.

17:44.640 --> 17:47.400
One day,
while they were out collecting fruits,

17:48.160 --> 17:49.480
I lowered the lantern on purpose.

17:50.880 --> 17:51.920
Guess what happened.

18:12.000 --> 18:13.400
That night,

18:13.480 --> 18:15.440
I had a feeling something might happen.

18:15.920 --> 18:18.080
So I sneaked out while you were asleep.

18:19.600 --> 18:21.600
And I encountered the tall female ghost

18:22.200 --> 18:23.360
you told me about.

18:44.160 --> 18:46.760
The curfews, the female ghost…

18:47.480 --> 18:50.160
So it was all meant to restrict us

18:50.640 --> 18:52.000
while she goes about her business.

18:52.480 --> 18:54.960
But if she gets caught,

18:55.040 --> 18:56.440
she'll be thrown into prison.

18:56.520 --> 18:58.680
Besides, there's a ceremony
at Helin Temple.

18:59.680 --> 19:01.880
With Mrs. Liu around,
why would the Chief dare to…

19:03.680 --> 19:04.600
I was the one

19:06.000 --> 19:07.120
who hung the lantern high.

19:19.280 --> 19:21.760
Miss, you're incredible.

19:22.960 --> 19:24.240
I'll go to Mrs. Liu now.

19:25.120 --> 19:25.960
Tong'er.

19:28.280 --> 19:29.280
To see Mrs. Liu,

19:30.000 --> 19:31.400
aside from the hairpin,

19:31.480 --> 19:32.520
you need a reason.

19:37.120 --> 19:37.960
Do it.

19:38.600 --> 19:41.280
No, must we go to this extent?

19:47.280 --> 19:48.320
This is our only chance.

19:49.400 --> 19:52.080
Unlike Jiang Li, I don't have any scars.

19:53.240 --> 19:55.920
Our act must be convincing enough

19:56.480 --> 19:57.920
to dispel any suspicion.

19:58.560 --> 20:01.960
We have to do it for Jiang Li's sake.

21:08.440 --> 21:10.760
MR. QIN

21:21.480 --> 21:22.320
My lord,

21:22.880 --> 21:24.040
Zhennv Hall is right ahead.

21:25.160 --> 21:26.360
Zhennv Hall?

21:26.440 --> 21:28.720
Women who can't go down the mountain
are detained there.

21:28.800 --> 21:30.480
It's a great hideout indeed.

21:52.440 --> 21:53.480
Who's there?

21:57.320 --> 21:58.160
Come out.

21:59.960 --> 22:00.880
Show yourself.

22:02.040 --> 22:02.880
Come out.

22:10.360 --> 22:12.760
Kind maiden, someone's after me.

22:14.280 --> 22:16.080
Please help me.

22:19.880 --> 22:21.280
This isn't a Buddhist temple

22:21.360 --> 22:22.840
and I'm not a kind maiden.

22:22.920 --> 22:25.440
You'll get discovered eventually
if you hide here.

22:26.280 --> 22:28.000
The back mountain forest
lies beyond those windows.

22:29.760 --> 22:31.960
Hurry up and go.

22:32.040 --> 22:33.080
Thank you.

22:57.560 --> 22:59.520
If you come any closer, I'll kill her.

23:00.040 --> 23:00.880
Be my guest.

23:02.120 --> 23:04.040
You can add murder to your crimes then.

23:11.960 --> 23:12.880
Duke Su.

23:14.800 --> 23:15.640
Mr. Qin,

23:15.720 --> 23:17.440
surrender quickly.

23:18.000 --> 23:19.160
You can't escape your crime

23:20.040 --> 23:21.240
of salt trafficking.

23:21.320 --> 23:22.600
What? I don't know what you're saying.

23:22.680 --> 23:24.840
Tell us where you got the salt.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.000
You made his lordship chase you

23:26.080 --> 23:27.560
to this lousy place from Helin Temple.

23:27.640 --> 23:28.840
If you don't come clean,

23:28.920 --> 23:30.560
even the heavens won't be able

23:30.640 --> 23:31.760
to save you.

23:31.840 --> 23:32.760
You can't fool me.

23:32.840 --> 23:35.720
I know I won't end up well in your hands.

23:35.800 --> 23:37.320
If you don't let me go today,

23:37.840 --> 23:39.080
I'll die regardless,

23:39.560 --> 23:40.840
so I may as well die here.

23:41.400 --> 23:44.240
At least a beautiful woman
will die with me.

23:44.800 --> 23:46.280
I've always been kind.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.920
Since that is what you want,

23:49.000 --> 23:50.320
I'll grant you your wish.

23:51.240 --> 23:53.080
In a moment, you and this beautiful woman

23:53.560 --> 23:54.960
will be reunited in the netherworld.

24:00.240 --> 24:02.600
Madam, my lady is dying.

24:02.680 --> 24:04.440
Please save her.

24:06.760 --> 24:08.200
This is the hairpin I gave Zhenzhen.

24:09.480 --> 24:10.720
Could she be…

24:10.800 --> 24:11.640
Li'er?

24:12.320 --> 24:13.440
Yes.

24:13.520 --> 24:14.640
Hurry, take me to her.

24:14.720 --> 24:15.920
All right, let's go.

24:23.520 --> 24:26.280
Dear, let's give up.

24:27.280 --> 24:28.120
What are you saying?

24:28.600 --> 24:31.120
I said, let's surrender.

24:32.760 --> 24:35.280
Duke Su has hunted us down here

24:36.120 --> 24:38.840
and captured both of us.

24:38.920 --> 24:40.280
What choice do we have?

24:42.240 --> 24:44.120
What are you talking about, you wench?

24:44.680 --> 24:46.120
Why did the higher-ups do this to us?

24:46.720 --> 24:47.800
We're forced into a corner.

24:48.440 --> 24:49.280
Release me first.

24:49.760 --> 24:52.480
Let's confess to Duke Su.

24:53.000 --> 24:54.800
He might let us live.

24:54.880 --> 24:56.120
Who exactly are you?

24:56.680 --> 24:58.800
I'm your accomplice, dear.

25:00.080 --> 25:01.200
Do it.

25:03.360 --> 25:04.240
What are you saying?

25:06.240 --> 25:08.800
So you two are in this together.

25:09.760 --> 25:10.680
Hurry up and kill her.

25:10.760 --> 25:13.160
I can take you away afterward.

25:13.240 --> 25:14.720
I'd like to see

25:15.600 --> 25:17.680
how you clean up your mess.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.320
I'll kill her now.

25:33.240 --> 25:35.440
I'll really kill her.

25:52.480 --> 25:53.440
- On your knees.
- Kneel.

25:56.000 --> 25:57.160
Get up.

25:57.240 --> 25:59.160
My lord, look at her.

25:59.760 --> 26:01.120
Doesn't she look familiar?

26:04.880 --> 26:06.800
My lady, check out this piece of cloth.

26:07.280 --> 26:09.360
My lady, someone is watching you
from the balcony.

26:11.000 --> 26:12.200
You don't see this everywhere.

26:14.960 --> 26:16.800
Printed clothes.

26:16.880 --> 26:17.920
Check them out.

26:28.080 --> 26:30.120
That's the new Top Scorer's wife,

26:30.200 --> 26:31.800
the most talented girl in Huaixiang.

26:31.880 --> 26:32.720
Isn't she beautiful?

26:34.560 --> 26:38.080
How do you know
she's the most talented girl in Huaixiang?

26:38.640 --> 26:41.120
He asked men to scout
for pretty and talented girls.

26:41.200 --> 26:42.040
Lu Ji, you…

26:42.520 --> 26:43.960
That's Duke Su.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.320
Yurong told me

26:46.400 --> 26:48.560
he's an arrogant and cruel man.

26:48.640 --> 26:51.360
We'd better not attract his attention.
Let's go.

27:00.760 --> 27:03.000
COFFIN OF HANLIN ACADEMY
SCHOLAR'S WIFE, MS. XUE

27:11.400 --> 27:13.040
By any chance,

27:13.920 --> 27:14.880
is your surname Xue?

27:17.160 --> 27:18.160
You got the wrong person.

27:19.920 --> 27:22.960
You're right. She's dead.

27:23.040 --> 27:25.040
She may be a ghost in the mountain,

27:26.280 --> 27:27.600
but a bandit?

27:28.520 --> 27:29.600
No way.

27:30.720 --> 27:32.360
Let me go!

27:32.440 --> 27:34.960
Don't listen to that crazy woman.
I'm innocent!

27:35.040 --> 27:36.760
You got the wrong guy. Let me go!

27:37.320 --> 27:39.240
Let go!

27:39.320 --> 27:40.320
How annoying.

27:43.280 --> 27:45.280
Bring him back and lock him up.

27:45.360 --> 27:46.240
Guards!

27:50.680 --> 27:52.800
I'll interrogate you right here and now.

27:53.280 --> 27:54.480
Once I'm done,

27:54.560 --> 27:56.720
I'll throw you back to your chief here.

27:57.520 --> 27:58.360
Get up.

28:03.520 --> 28:05.040
Duke Su, are you looking down on me?

28:05.600 --> 28:08.000
You're such an insolent woman!

28:08.080 --> 28:09.480
Do you think a girl from Zhennv Hall

28:10.520 --> 28:12.320
can't traffic salt?

28:12.920 --> 28:15.160
I know as much as that man,

28:15.240 --> 28:16.600
but why is he the only one

28:17.280 --> 28:18.680
you're bringing back to the capital?

28:18.760 --> 28:20.440
You're begging me to imprison you?

28:22.080 --> 28:23.320
How interesting.

28:23.400 --> 28:24.560
In this place,

28:25.600 --> 28:27.840
you can't force a confession out of me.

28:29.080 --> 28:30.520
Isn't it inconvenient?

28:33.840 --> 28:36.040
Li'er, are you there?

28:37.240 --> 28:38.200
Li'er!

28:38.880 --> 28:40.520
If we hadn't barged in today,

28:41.760 --> 28:43.480
you'd probably be doing a different act.

28:45.640 --> 28:47.520
You said your surname isn't Xue.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.840
Take me back to the capital
for interrogation

28:50.480 --> 28:51.680
and you'll know everything.

28:53.960 --> 28:56.040
Will I be able to see the act

28:56.120 --> 28:57.240
you originally planned?

28:58.120 --> 28:59.520
Do you want to watch it?

28:59.600 --> 29:00.960
I may as well.

29:03.440 --> 29:05.920
Tie me up and bring me out.

29:06.560 --> 29:07.520
I'll show you.

29:16.360 --> 29:18.120
My lady, why are you tied up?

29:18.600 --> 29:19.440
Don't touch her.

29:19.520 --> 29:21.480
She's Duke Su's convicted criminal.

29:22.640 --> 29:23.640
What's happening?

29:24.200 --> 29:25.320
What exactly is going on?

29:25.400 --> 29:26.880
Mrs. Liu, right?

29:28.120 --> 29:29.320
Duke Su.

29:29.400 --> 29:31.560
I pursued a wanted criminal to this place

29:31.640 --> 29:34.360
and stumbled upon
his suspected accomplice.

29:34.440 --> 29:37.560
I need to take her back for interrogation.

29:37.640 --> 29:40.960
There must be a misunderstanding, Duke Su.

29:41.880 --> 29:45.040
Tong'er, she is…

29:45.120 --> 29:45.960
My lady,

29:46.040 --> 29:46.960
this is Mrs. Liu,

29:47.040 --> 29:49.080
who used to visit you and Madam.

29:52.680 --> 29:55.040
Mrs. Liu? You're so…

29:56.240 --> 29:58.280
Help me, Mrs. Liu.

29:59.360 --> 30:01.040
I'm not a criminal's accomplice.

30:02.280 --> 30:04.720
I was set up.
I tried to explain, but to no avail.

30:05.840 --> 30:07.760
I don't want to be taken
to the capital for trial.

30:08.280 --> 30:09.360
Help me.

30:09.440 --> 30:10.880
All right, don't fret.

30:12.960 --> 30:15.800
Duke Su, how can you
randomly arrest people?

30:15.880 --> 30:17.120
This is Zhennv Hall.

30:17.920 --> 30:20.200
You're taking a girl from here

30:20.280 --> 30:22.360
without informing the Chief.

30:22.440 --> 30:24.640
Don't you think it's inappropriate?

30:25.880 --> 30:28.280
Mrs. Liu, please ask the Chief

30:29.440 --> 30:30.800
to plead on my behalf.

30:30.880 --> 30:31.760
Don't worry.

30:31.840 --> 30:32.960
I'll go get the Chief

30:33.040 --> 30:34.600
to do you justice.

30:36.280 --> 30:38.680
I'll be waiting here, Mrs. Liu.

31:09.440 --> 31:10.400
What are you doing here?

31:11.000 --> 31:12.520
You hung the lantern high,

31:13.360 --> 31:14.560
so here I am.

31:15.560 --> 31:16.400
Lantern?

31:19.560 --> 31:21.480
Not now, I have an important guest.

31:21.560 --> 31:22.600
You need to leave.

31:23.840 --> 31:25.840
Get up. Leave now.

31:29.360 --> 31:30.440
I'm already here.

31:31.040 --> 31:33.440
I checked, there's no one out there.

31:35.760 --> 31:36.640
Let go.

32:24.480 --> 32:25.440
Mrs. Liu!

32:27.520 --> 32:29.640
You indecent, obscene,

32:29.720 --> 32:32.040
lascivious, shameless people!

32:32.760 --> 32:35.280
Girls, capture this scandalous couple!

32:39.200 --> 32:40.280
You two.

32:42.560 --> 32:44.120
Capture them!

32:46.840 --> 32:47.760
Mrs. Liu.

32:50.480 --> 32:51.440
Keep walking.

32:52.960 --> 32:53.880
- Kneel!
- Kneel down!

32:59.240 --> 33:01.280
This is my first time

33:01.360 --> 33:03.880
seeing the Chief dragged here,
all tied up.

33:04.960 --> 33:06.880
I've really seen it all
in Qingcheng Mountain.

33:07.520 --> 33:10.160
Mrs. Liu, I… I was set up.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.600
I saw it with my own eyes.

33:11.680 --> 33:13.600
How can you deny it in front of Duke Su?

33:15.240 --> 33:16.640
This is out of my jurisdiction.

33:17.440 --> 33:18.560
Mrs. Liu, you decide.

33:18.640 --> 33:21.720
Guards, wake up all the girls.

33:21.800 --> 33:23.160
Leave two to stand guard.

33:23.680 --> 33:25.000
Lock up all the rest.

33:25.480 --> 33:27.640
We'll bring them to the government office
for trial tomorrow.

33:28.200 --> 33:29.720
These filthy animals.

33:30.480 --> 33:31.760
Just looking at them makes me angry.

33:31.840 --> 33:33.040
Lock them up now!

33:33.120 --> 33:34.000
- Yes.
- Yes.

33:34.080 --> 33:36.480
- It's not what you think, Mrs. Liu.
- Get up.

33:36.560 --> 33:37.440
- I'm wronged!
- Come on.

33:37.520 --> 33:38.440
Mrs. Liu!

33:38.520 --> 33:39.600
- Let's go.
- Mrs. Liu!

33:40.600 --> 33:41.640
Mrs. Liu.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.760
Can I take my criminal now?

33:50.240 --> 33:51.280
My…

33:52.960 --> 33:53.920
My lord,

33:54.520 --> 33:55.360
she's wounded.

34:05.000 --> 34:07.080
What should we do? Take her away or…

34:08.000 --> 34:09.159
Find a room for her to rest.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.840
And…

34:12.600 --> 34:13.440
You.

34:14.880 --> 34:15.719
Come here.

34:22.880 --> 34:24.920
- Interrogate this girl.
- Yes.

34:46.360 --> 34:47.880
You're finally awake.

34:48.719 --> 34:51.239
Mrs. Liu, sorry for the trouble.

34:51.800 --> 34:53.159
You've suffered.

34:54.280 --> 34:55.560
Why are you wounded like this?

34:56.600 --> 34:57.440
Don't move.

34:58.480 --> 34:59.360
Are you still dizzy?

35:00.560 --> 35:01.560
Lie down a bit longer.

35:05.720 --> 35:07.080
How did you get these wounds?

35:09.680 --> 35:10.840
There's no need to tell me.

35:10.920 --> 35:13.000
That bitch must have tortured you.

35:13.920 --> 35:16.240
When your maid brought this hairpin to me,

35:16.840 --> 35:19.560
I knew you were in trouble.

35:20.880 --> 35:22.160
If your mother knew

35:22.240 --> 35:23.960
what you've endured here,

35:24.480 --> 35:25.920
she'd be devastated.

35:26.560 --> 35:27.400
Mrs. Liu,

35:28.480 --> 35:30.160
it's all right. It's all in the past now.

35:31.440 --> 35:33.200
It's already enough for me

35:33.760 --> 35:35.080
to get to see you.

35:35.720 --> 35:37.600
But I wonder

35:37.680 --> 35:38.560
if Duke Su would…

35:38.640 --> 35:40.280
Don't worry, Li'er.

35:40.840 --> 35:43.240
Even if I can't snatch you away
from Duke Su,

35:43.320 --> 35:44.680
I can ask your family

35:44.760 --> 35:46.080
to take you from him.

35:46.560 --> 35:47.400
Just wait.

35:59.200 --> 36:00.120
Be quick!

36:00.200 --> 36:01.200
KIND AND MORAL REPUTATION

36:01.280 --> 36:02.120
Pick up the pace.

36:08.560 --> 36:11.440
Duke Su, I heard you're fond
of forcing confessions via torture.

36:11.520 --> 36:13.000
But let me warn you,

36:13.080 --> 36:14.600
she's the chancellor's
legitimate daughter.

36:14.680 --> 36:17.400
If I find even a scratch on her,

36:17.480 --> 36:20.560
I'll report it immediately
to the Chancellor Jiang.

36:20.640 --> 36:21.640
Does the Jiang family

36:23.160 --> 36:24.480
still care about her?

36:24.560 --> 36:26.080
Even if they don't,

36:26.720 --> 36:29.320
do you think the imperial court
will let you off?

36:37.880 --> 36:39.360
Mrs. Liu is something.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.520
Back to business.

36:43.440 --> 36:45.720
Shall we take her away
once she regains consciousness?

36:46.320 --> 36:47.760
Let her rest for a night.

36:48.720 --> 36:51.240
Or I'd get accused
of mistreating a criminal again.

36:51.320 --> 36:53.120
But Mr. Qin has been taken away.

36:53.600 --> 36:54.960
Does she get a special treatment?

36:55.720 --> 36:58.920
Prepare some paper and ink.
I have a memorial to write.

37:00.760 --> 37:04.640
I want to join in the fun for Zhennv Hall.

37:04.720 --> 37:05.560
Yes.

37:07.360 --> 37:08.880
KIND AND MORAL REPUTATION

37:10.240 --> 37:11.080
Tong'er.

37:13.040 --> 37:14.000
I'm sorry, Miss.

37:14.640 --> 37:16.720
I told them your wounds
are self-inflicted.

37:17.760 --> 37:19.240
I'm so useless.

37:20.840 --> 37:21.760
It's all right.

37:22.720 --> 37:23.920
It doesn't matter anymore.

37:25.000 --> 37:25.920
Miss,

37:26.000 --> 37:27.520
how did Duke Su get involved?

37:36.360 --> 37:37.480
It was an accident.

37:37.560 --> 37:39.240
Everyone is saying

37:39.960 --> 37:41.880
he's going to take you
to the capital for trial.

37:42.760 --> 37:44.000
Isn't that great?

37:45.120 --> 37:46.360
We'll play along.

37:47.600 --> 37:50.640
We can finally leave Qingcheng Mountain
and go back to the capital.

37:50.720 --> 37:51.560
But miss,

37:52.040 --> 37:53.680
even if we make it to the capital,

37:53.760 --> 37:55.200
we can't go back to the Jiang family.

37:55.880 --> 37:58.920
Besides, will Mrs. Liu
really go to the Jiang family?

37:59.000 --> 38:01.360
Mrs. Liu doesn't need to plead
with the Jiang family.

38:02.720 --> 38:04.760
The Chief's illicit sexual relations

38:04.840 --> 38:06.760
has already given Duke Liu
a reason to speak

38:06.840 --> 38:07.840
at the imperial court.

38:08.400 --> 38:10.200
Once this matter is brought up
in the imperial court

38:10.280 --> 38:11.400
in front of His Majesty,

38:11.960 --> 38:13.160
the Jiang family will be forced

38:13.240 --> 38:15.160
to remember the daughter
they abandoned for ten years.

38:16.120 --> 38:17.680
A reputable family like the Jiangs

38:18.320 --> 38:20.120
cannot risk being seen as heartless.

38:21.200 --> 38:23.880
So, whether they like it or not,

38:23.960 --> 38:25.680
they must

38:26.320 --> 38:27.480
take Jiang Li back,

38:28.200 --> 38:30.320
and make it look grand.

38:35.040 --> 38:37.760
ZHENNV HALL

38:44.760 --> 38:46.000
Did you sleep well?

38:57.960 --> 38:59.280
Were you up all night, Duke Su?

39:08.920 --> 39:10.360
I've been thinking all night.

39:11.120 --> 39:12.760
What exactly is your surname?

39:12.840 --> 39:15.000
Didn't you ask Mrs. Liu, Duke Su?

39:16.120 --> 39:18.440
She said your name seems to be…

39:19.760 --> 39:20.600
Lihua?

39:24.000 --> 39:24.960
Limao?

39:26.960 --> 39:28.000
Little civet?

39:28.920 --> 39:30.360
Please behave, Duke Su.

39:31.120 --> 39:34.000
This is the first time
a criminal told me to behave.

39:35.280 --> 39:37.480
That's not the behavior of a criminal.

39:38.080 --> 39:38.920
How about now?

39:40.920 --> 39:43.040
Yesterday, you mutilated your back.

39:43.840 --> 39:45.720
Today, you ask to be tied up.

39:47.680 --> 39:50.880
You're risking your life too much.

39:51.440 --> 39:54.560
I don't think you're afraid
of people who risk their lives, Duke Su.

39:58.360 --> 39:59.360
I'll get going.

40:07.920 --> 40:08.840
Miss.

40:50.640 --> 40:57.640
FILIAL PIETY, VIRTUOUS,
FAITHFUL, UNSWERVING

41:07.680 --> 41:09.480
TAIJI HALL

41:09.560 --> 41:11.760
HEAVEN'S AUSPICIOUS RESPONSE
TO MONARCH'S HIGH VIRTUE

41:12.480 --> 41:14.680
I've checked people's sentiments

41:14.760 --> 41:17.760
like Your Majesty requested
and prepared a report.

41:22.360 --> 41:24.160
I heard your wife just passed away.

41:24.240 --> 41:26.240
Despite being busy
with the funeral for many days,

41:26.320 --> 41:28.120
you've completed the task

41:28.200 --> 41:29.320
I entrusted you so well.

41:29.400 --> 41:30.640
You're really a capable official.

41:32.040 --> 41:33.000
Your Majesty,

41:33.840 --> 41:36.320
my wife's recent death

41:37.040 --> 41:38.440
has left me crestfallen before.

41:38.520 --> 41:41.680
As I needed to travel
to her home for her funeral,

41:41.760 --> 41:44.160
I couldn't do my best
in Your Majesty's assigned task.

41:44.720 --> 41:46.000
I feel anxious.

41:46.960 --> 41:48.680
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

41:48.760 --> 41:50.600
It's normal. You've done no wrong.

41:51.160 --> 41:53.160
Your devotion to your wife

41:53.240 --> 41:55.400
and filial piety to her family

41:55.480 --> 41:56.920
should be emulated by everyone.

41:57.000 --> 41:59.280
Let this be an example to all officials.

41:59.760 --> 42:02.720
Those who exhibit love
to one's wife and filial piety to family

42:02.800 --> 42:06.120
should be recommended
and valued by the imperial court.

42:06.960 --> 42:07.920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

42:10.160 --> 42:11.160
Minister Jiang.

42:13.960 --> 42:15.960
JIANG YUANBAI

42:16.040 --> 42:16.880
Your Majesty.

42:16.960 --> 42:19.280
What is the progress
on the mausoleum construction?

42:19.840 --> 42:23.000
Empress Dowager Xia's mausoleum
is nearly complete.

42:23.080 --> 42:26.960
All that's left is the engraving
of seal characters in the three shrines.

42:27.720 --> 42:30.280
It will be completed next month

42:30.360 --> 42:32.280
before the Transfer of Remains Ceremony.

42:32.360 --> 42:34.760
I could not honor my mother
while she was alive.

42:35.720 --> 42:38.960
Minister Jiang, your suggestion
to construct a mausoleum

42:39.040 --> 42:41.760
comforts the heavens and my conscience.

42:41.840 --> 42:44.760
Moreover, you volunteered
to oversee its construction.

42:44.840 --> 42:47.440
You're presiding over the mausoleum
construction and working so hard.

42:47.520 --> 42:50.600
You're so considerate of me.

42:51.160 --> 42:53.920
It's my pleasure to do it, Your Majesty.

42:54.000 --> 42:55.120
There's no need for courtesy.

42:56.320 --> 42:57.160
Your Majesty.

42:59.360 --> 43:01.000
I just found out
from the Ministry of Works

43:01.760 --> 43:02.960
that the mausoleum construction

43:03.960 --> 43:05.160
caused a big deficit.

43:07.960 --> 43:11.720
Your Majesty, it was so hot
in the suburbs last month.

43:11.800 --> 43:14.120
Some of the mausoleum workmen

43:14.200 --> 43:15.760
collapsed due to heat stroke

43:16.280 --> 43:18.520
and construction had to be halted.

43:18.600 --> 43:20.360
But the transfer of remains
can't be delayed,

43:20.440 --> 43:24.200
so we had no choice but to mobilize
more workmen to meet the deadline

43:24.280 --> 43:27.400
and hire men to transport water
from the south of the city

43:27.480 --> 43:29.040
to supply the workmen's needs.

43:29.120 --> 43:30.760
All these things came at a cost.

43:31.280 --> 43:34.120
But how can it be slandered
as causing a deficit?

43:34.200 --> 43:37.040
As expected,
you love the people like yourself,

43:37.120 --> 43:37.960
Chief Secretariat.

43:38.520 --> 43:41.280
But the mausoleum's construction
is important to the imperial court.

43:41.760 --> 43:43.640
Forget about gossip among the people.

43:44.120 --> 43:46.880
Even the imperial censors
are intently watching it.

43:47.640 --> 43:50.080
Changing the budget
without permission is no small matter.

43:51.160 --> 43:53.560
You've become quite the celebrity
for this, Chancellor Jiang.

43:53.640 --> 43:56.080
But public opinion turns lies into truth,
let me remind you,

43:56.840 --> 43:58.360
What do you take His Majesty for?

43:58.920 --> 43:59.760
Chancellor Li!

43:59.840 --> 44:01.000
- Chancellor Jiang…
- Enough.

44:02.160 --> 44:04.480
The imperial palace
will shoulder the excess cost.

44:04.560 --> 44:06.840
There's no need to argue.

44:07.760 --> 44:08.680
- Yes.
- Yes.

44:13.200 --> 44:14.160
Official Liu.

44:16.560 --> 44:17.760
Yes, Your Majesty.

44:17.840 --> 44:21.360
Zhennv Hall of Qingcheng Mountain
is neither an official nunnery

44:21.440 --> 44:23.680
nor a private school.

44:23.760 --> 44:25.320
Yet I heard

44:25.400 --> 44:28.320
it received sizable donations
from the capital's officials

44:28.400 --> 44:29.920
in the past few years.

44:30.640 --> 44:31.920
How could such a ridiculous thing

44:32.000 --> 44:34.760
happen in a place like that?

44:35.320 --> 44:36.160
Your Majesty.

44:37.640 --> 44:40.000
My wife paid a visit to Zhennv Hall

44:40.520 --> 44:42.080
and witnessed everything last night.

44:42.640 --> 44:45.080
The Chief Secretariat's daughter,
Jiang Li, can attest to it.

44:45.600 --> 44:47.040
This matter is definitely true.

44:47.600 --> 44:50.960
Why is Chief Secretariat's daughter there?

44:53.000 --> 44:54.040
Your Majesty.

44:55.880 --> 44:58.680
My daughter made a serious mistake before,

44:58.760 --> 45:01.840
so I sent her to Zhennv Hall
to cultivate herself.

45:02.760 --> 45:05.520
Minister Jiang, I don't mean to pry

45:05.600 --> 45:06.720
into your family's affairs.

45:06.800 --> 45:08.400
Your daughter was sent to the mountain

45:08.480 --> 45:10.280
ages ago

45:10.360 --> 45:12.360
and you still haven't brought her back?

45:12.440 --> 45:15.040
Thank you for your concern,
Chancellor Li and Duke Liu.

45:15.640 --> 45:18.880
I will handle my family affairs properly.

45:18.960 --> 45:21.600
I just want you
and your daughter to reunite soon.

45:24.920 --> 45:26.520
Given the last memorial,

45:26.600 --> 45:28.280
Duke Su's memorial

45:29.160 --> 45:30.920
isn't a surprise to me.

45:31.000 --> 45:32.480
The girls of Zhennv Hall

45:32.560 --> 45:35.160
are in cahoots
with salt trafficking fugitives,

45:35.240 --> 45:37.080
harboring criminals,
and hiding dirty money.

45:37.160 --> 45:38.920
That's unforgivable!

45:39.000 --> 45:41.280
I've already ordered Duke Su
to get to the bottom of this.

45:41.360 --> 45:43.240
Whoever is behind this,

45:43.320 --> 45:45.040
I won't tolerate it!

45:45.840 --> 45:49.960
JIANG RESIDENCE

45:55.840 --> 45:57.360
The cold weather in the past few days

45:57.440 --> 45:59.120
calls for something warm.

46:00.520 --> 46:02.000
Take these bland dishes away

46:02.520 --> 46:05.440
from his lordship and Mother.

46:05.520 --> 46:07.440
Take wild ducks from the farm

46:08.440 --> 46:13.440
and make herbal soup
with tianma and huangqi.

46:13.520 --> 46:16.280
No one knows Mr. Jiang
and Old Madam's palate

46:16.360 --> 46:17.800
better than you, Madam.

46:18.720 --> 46:20.560
I just take extra care

46:20.640 --> 46:22.040
to make everything organized.

46:22.120 --> 46:23.000
Go and prepare it.

46:23.560 --> 46:24.400
Yes.

46:26.840 --> 46:27.680
My lord.

46:31.440 --> 46:32.360
Dear.

46:35.960 --> 46:37.600
Why are you in such haste?

46:38.960 --> 46:40.880
Pick up Jiang Li now.

46:43.160 --> 46:44.320
Why…

46:45.480 --> 46:46.840
Why are you suddenly saying that?

46:46.920 --> 46:49.760
His Majesty read two memorials today.

46:50.360 --> 46:52.400
One from Liu Yuanfeng,

46:52.480 --> 46:54.360
one from Duke Su.

47:02.000 --> 47:03.400
Do you mean Duke Liu

47:03.480 --> 47:07.080
actually brought this issue to His Majesty

47:07.640 --> 47:09.160
and humiliated you?

47:09.240 --> 47:11.320
Don't you know Liu Yuanfeng?

47:12.440 --> 47:15.400
Back in the day, your father
hindered his career by placing

47:15.480 --> 47:17.040
his own people in the imperial court.

47:17.840 --> 47:20.800
Would he pass up this chance
to report the Jiang family?

47:21.360 --> 47:23.000
What a good timing for his report.

47:23.640 --> 47:27.520
The Empress Dowager Xia's mausoleum
is about to be completed.

47:27.600 --> 47:30.280
His Majesty misses his mother

47:30.360 --> 47:31.800
and is fulfilling his filial piety now.

47:32.720 --> 47:34.560
His Majesty lost his mother at a young age

47:34.640 --> 47:36.320
and the Empress Dowager disliked him.

47:36.400 --> 47:38.080
You know that.

47:38.960 --> 47:41.000
Liu Yuanfeng's memorial

47:41.560 --> 47:43.760
played to His Majesty's vulnerability

47:44.320 --> 47:47.360
while putting pressure on me.

47:47.440 --> 47:48.760
Li'er is a Jiang after all.

47:50.280 --> 47:52.760
Now that Zhennv Hall is rife with scandal,

47:52.840 --> 47:54.880
even if His Majesty
and Duke Liu didn't mention it,

47:55.760 --> 47:57.200
we should bring Li'er home.

48:00.680 --> 48:02.040
Don't you blame her?

48:02.120 --> 48:03.840
Why should I?

48:04.560 --> 48:05.600
It has been so many years.

48:06.320 --> 48:08.000
I believe she has long repented.

48:08.840 --> 48:10.000
Besides,

48:10.080 --> 48:12.040
nothing is more important

48:12.560 --> 48:14.840
than our innocence and reputation.

48:15.800 --> 48:17.920
Please decide what to do about this.

48:19.840 --> 48:21.000
The problem is,

48:21.600 --> 48:25.000
Li'er is still in Duke Su's custody.

48:25.600 --> 48:26.520
Duke Su?

48:28.160 --> 48:29.400
Why is she in his hands?

48:30.640 --> 48:32.880
I have no idea how he was able

48:32.960 --> 48:35.200
to accuse Li'er of harboring a fugitive

48:35.280 --> 48:36.680
and hiding dirty money.

48:37.520 --> 48:39.560
If she's found guilty,

48:39.640 --> 48:41.520
even without Li Zhongnan's slander,

48:41.600 --> 48:44.960
our reputation will be ruined forever.

48:46.840 --> 48:48.600
I must talk to Duke Su.

48:49.880 --> 48:51.520
If I manage to get her back,

48:52.160 --> 48:54.840
we can't handle this matter quietly,

48:54.920 --> 48:57.160
lest we seem guilty.

48:57.760 --> 48:59.360
I understand, dear.

49:00.320 --> 49:02.000
If Duke Su agrees to let her go,

49:02.600 --> 49:03.960
you can leave

49:04.720 --> 49:06.480
Li'er's return to me.

49:07.960 --> 49:10.040
We will celebrate
your second daughter's return

49:10.520 --> 49:12.720
in an open and grand manner.

49:13.240 --> 49:16.280
No one will be able
to gossip about us then.

49:17.960 --> 49:18.800
Dear.

49:20.640 --> 49:22.560
You are so benevolent

49:23.360 --> 49:25.360
and considerate.

49:25.920 --> 49:27.080
I am so moved.

49:27.560 --> 49:28.760
You've endured so much

49:30.760 --> 49:32.720
all these years.

49:35.840 --> 49:38.240
What Li'er did to you then…

49:39.000 --> 49:40.320
It's all in the past now.

49:42.640 --> 49:45.560
If you hadn't mentioned it, I…

49:50.440 --> 49:51.280
I…

49:52.320 --> 49:55.240
I almost forgot our unborn child.

49:58.840 --> 49:59.680
Dear.

50:01.120 --> 50:02.360
I promise you,

50:04.280 --> 50:08.480
if Li'er is still the same as before
and has not repented,

50:09.360 --> 50:11.640
if she still resents you,

50:12.240 --> 50:13.840
I won't spare her.

50:16.000 --> 50:16.920
Thank you, dear.

50:49.520 --> 50:50.440
After using me,

50:52.040 --> 50:53.760
don't you owe me an explanation?

50:54.320 --> 50:57.240
Duke Su, what would you like to know?

50:58.040 --> 50:59.360
What is your surname?

50:59.440 --> 51:01.520
You should already know.

51:01.600 --> 51:02.520
I ask the questions,

51:03.560 --> 51:04.560
you answer.

51:06.960 --> 51:07.840
My surname is Jiang.

51:08.720 --> 51:10.040
My first name is Li.

51:11.440 --> 51:14.440
I am the daughter
of the Chief Secretariat.

51:14.520 --> 51:16.680
Why did you collude with salt traffickers?

51:23.360 --> 51:24.200
I lied.

51:26.760 --> 51:27.680
You lied?

51:28.440 --> 51:30.320
So it wasn't a collusion…

51:36.920 --> 51:38.160
but a tryst?

51:38.840 --> 51:39.840
Watch your words, Duke Su.

51:42.280 --> 51:43.640
I don't even know him.

51:44.480 --> 51:47.280
I was waiting for Mrs. Liu
in the ancestral shrine.

51:47.840 --> 51:50.240
I didn't lure any of you in.

51:51.080 --> 51:52.840
You all barged in on your own accord.

51:53.880 --> 51:55.440
That's not the answer I'm looking for.

51:58.120 --> 51:59.200
That's my only answer.

52:04.840 --> 52:06.720
No one leaves my interrogation room

52:09.760 --> 52:11.600
without telling me the answer I want.

52:13.560 --> 52:14.480
Perhaps

52:15.720 --> 52:16.640
I'm an exception.

52:28.440 --> 52:29.800
My lord, Chancellor Jiang is here.

52:29.880 --> 52:30.760
He's in the main hall.

52:31.760 --> 52:32.720
Already?

52:33.240 --> 52:34.920
He has a message for you.

52:35.000 --> 52:35.840
What is it?

52:35.920 --> 52:37.360
He says if you dare to force a confession,

52:37.440 --> 52:39.320
he'll bring his official seal
and report you to His Majesty.

52:40.960 --> 52:43.960
All right.
I guess she can't stay here anymore.

52:44.040 --> 52:46.680
Did she trick us all this time?

52:46.760 --> 52:48.240
She made us arrest her,

52:48.320 --> 52:50.760
yet we can't interrogate or question her.

52:50.840 --> 52:52.080
It's like we invited a god here.

52:54.760 --> 52:56.440
Treating this as a charade

52:57.920 --> 52:58.880
is good too.

52:58.960 --> 53:00.000
What shall we do with her?

53:00.760 --> 53:02.080
Take good care of her.

53:02.760 --> 53:05.800
See that no harm comes to her
until the Jiang family picks her up.

53:05.880 --> 53:07.640
But we don't have any women here.

53:10.920 --> 53:12.240
Go fetch her maid.

53:13.440 --> 53:15.960
My lord, Ms. Jiang has a request.

53:16.040 --> 53:16.880
Out with it.

53:17.840 --> 53:20.360
She'd like you to arrange
for her to speak to some people

53:20.440 --> 53:21.600
from Zhennv Hall.

53:23.320 --> 53:25.200
What makes her think I'd help her?

53:26.360 --> 53:29.120
She said she'd starve herself
if you don't help her

53:30.040 --> 53:32.440
and you can't hand her over
to the Jiang family unharmed.

53:41.880 --> 53:43.000
Where's Duke Su?

53:43.080 --> 53:45.000
He's just finished
the interrogation and is resting.

53:45.720 --> 53:46.960
Where is my daughter?

53:48.480 --> 53:49.920
I want to see her now.

53:50.560 --> 53:52.040
Don't be anxious, Chancellor Jiang.

53:52.120 --> 53:53.680
His lordship has straightened things out

53:53.760 --> 53:54.880
with your daughter.

53:54.960 --> 53:55.960
It was a misunderstanding.

53:56.040 --> 53:57.040
Ms. Jiang is innocent

53:57.120 --> 53:59.280
and unharmed.

53:59.360 --> 54:00.760
She just had a little scare.

54:00.840 --> 54:03.640
His lordship wants you to know

54:03.720 --> 54:06.400
that you're free to take Jiang Li home.

54:08.360 --> 54:10.120
Anything else?

54:10.200 --> 54:11.400
He did say a couple of things.

54:11.480 --> 54:13.360
First, he said
you can just thank His Majesty

54:13.440 --> 54:15.320
for this matter.

54:15.880 --> 54:16.720
Second,

54:16.800 --> 54:18.960
when you're picking her up from here,

54:19.040 --> 54:20.040
he will give her

54:20.120 --> 54:22.200
half of the ceremonial weapons here

54:22.280 --> 54:23.480
to escort her home

54:23.560 --> 54:25.720
and prove her innocence.

54:31.080 --> 54:32.320
What are you doing here?

54:33.040 --> 54:33.960
I've come to help you.

54:48.640 --> 54:50.440
I'm profiting from your misfortune.

54:51.880 --> 54:53.440
I can go home to the Jiang family now.

54:54.160 --> 54:56.000
So I'll make sure you get to live.

54:56.960 --> 54:58.400
That's all?

54:58.960 --> 54:59.800
Of course.

55:01.360 --> 55:04.880
However, all of you
must keep Jiang Li's secret

55:05.720 --> 55:07.120
hidden forever.

55:07.680 --> 55:09.280
It's for your own good.

55:09.360 --> 55:10.760
This case's trial is coming up.

55:11.240 --> 55:13.960
Your affair was a violation of customs

55:14.040 --> 55:15.200
and an offense against decency.

55:15.280 --> 55:16.800
It has nothing to do with them,

55:16.880 --> 55:18.000
and you don't deserve to die.

55:18.640 --> 55:21.680
With me pleading for you,
you'll spend a few days in jail, at most.

55:21.760 --> 55:23.640
If you get pardoned,
you'll be released even earlier.

55:23.720 --> 55:27.120
However, killing the daughter
of the Chancellor

55:27.960 --> 55:29.320
is a capital crime.

55:30.880 --> 55:33.560
I may have stolen someone's identity
out of greed,

55:33.640 --> 55:34.760
but it doesn't harm anyone.

55:35.640 --> 55:38.720
But you girls took someone's life.

55:40.360 --> 55:41.760
All of you can't be spared.

55:42.560 --> 55:45.320
Don't you ever think
of blackmailing me with this.

55:45.800 --> 55:47.000
I'll live,

55:47.880 --> 55:49.840
but I can watch you die.

56:02.240 --> 56:04.040
- Chief.
- Chief.
